abstract: >
Scripts for the analysis of deformed and degrading C-ring samples
using scanning 2D XRD and micro-computed tomography (µCT).
Analyzed are strain distributions over time or different deformation
conditions and degradation parameters depending on tensile and
compressive strain regions.
 
